OL,3,GNEWSALong-lost artworks of former
OL,4,Astations go on display
OL,5,
OL,6,FIllustrations which captured the grand
OL,7,Fstations of the pioneering North
OL,8,FMidland Railway have gone on permanent
OL,9,Fdisplay in the last original building
OL,10,Fstanding.
OL,12,FThe railway, engineered by George
OL,13,FStephenson and opened in 1840, linked
OL,14,FDerby to Leeds via a mainline following
OL,15,Friver valleys.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
