OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSALong-lost artworks of former
OL,4,Astations go on display
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlong its route, a series of ornate and
OL,7,Funique station buildings were designed
OL,8,Fby architect Francis Thompson - from a
OL,9,Fpalatial 1,000ft frontage with a piazza
OL,10,Fand fountains at Derby, to a miniature
OL,11,FItalianate design at Belper, to
OL,12,FJacobite-style buildings at Ambergate
OL,13,Fand Chesterfield.
OL,15,FThe original metal etchings from 1841
OL,16,Fhave now been placed on display at
OL,17,FWingfield, the sole survivor from the
OL,18,Foriginal 16 stations.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
